<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60312" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτέᾰν-ον</span></b> , τό<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκτάομαἰ</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.2
			</span></i>, Epic. ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				378
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antim.
			</span></i>(?)); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. φιλίης</span>, of a child, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				388
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Apamea</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> usu. in pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτέανα</span>, <i>possessions, property</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				315
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				3.42
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				9.32
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημοσίων κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Xenoph.
					2.8
				</span></i>
			; used in lyr. by <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				729
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1573
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				490
			</span></i>; by <i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>(?) in hexam. ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				378
			</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				242
			</span></i>); by <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
			</span></i> in a mock heroic line, <i><span class="en">
				139
			</span></i>: in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				27
			</span></i>; <i>property in cattle</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				25.109
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτῆνος</span>:— <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only in heterocl. dat. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτεάτεσσι</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτέαρ</span>),
				<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.829
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.115
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				5.24
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				791.3
			</span></i> (hex.): dat. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κτεάτοις</span>
			Hdn.Gr. <i><span class="en">
				2.936
			</span></i>. (Cf. Avest. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σ̆αε̄τα</span>-
			'property', 'wealth'.)</div>
